From 4956d2e75c2eb59901c903adf8d5c4a2ed2038bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 06:51:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP jdk-determinism: StrictMath routing prototype

Every non-correctly-rounded elementary function of the fluid code goes
through science/math/DeterministicMath, which returns the StrictMath
(fdlibm 5.3) result bit for bit on every JVM, OS and CPU. pow is an
allocation-free transliteration of fdlibm e_pow.c (FdlibmPow), bitwise
equal to StrictMath.pow on 1.5 billion inputs on five runtimes, because
JDK 21-27's StrictMath.pow allocates 96 bytes per call and costs 7x
Math.pow. Math.sqrt, Math.fma and the exact Math functions stay.

- Routed: science/fluid/**, science/thermo/**, science/material/**
  (ViscosityCorrelation) and science/column/v3/thermo/V3WaterProperties
  (the fluid water model): 91 call sites in 13 files. The rest of the
  column is left for the owner's scope decision (review 12.2).
- DeterministicMathSourceTest (fluidScienceTest): fails on any direct
  Math/StrictMath log/exp/pow/cbrt/trig/... call in science/, runtime/
  and the fluid/benchmark fixtures, outside the facade.
- DeterministicMathTest: pow bitwise equal to StrictMath.pow on special
  values and 2 million samples; no allocation.
- Fixtures: the chain pressure cos (values unchanged) and the random
  compositions of TranslatedPengRobinsonDerivativesTest.
- Re-baseline (one time, fresh world): chain-100.json re-captured
  (max 5.7e-15 relative moles; same steps and Newton counts) and the
  harness reference junction lines (28 of 33 change); both are
  byte-identical on all 36 runtimes of the sweep and equal to what
  OpenJ9 produced on the base code. No assertion or tolerance changed.

Gates: fluid suites 477/477, fluidSolverRegression exact 0.000e+00
after the re-capture, adjacent 45/45, compileFluidGameTestJava and
compileMcpCompatJava green, full test 1169/1171 (2 column tests fail
through the shared V3WaterProperties; review 10.6). Cost: +17 % wall
of the runtime suite, +46 % MIXED_GAS_COST, allocation unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0143XediYypAPUZTWX7ACGmQ
